  "reasoning": "The defendant organized and carried out the illegal removal, transport, and sale of two ancient soapberry trees that are protected as \"古树名木\" under forestry protection regulations. The trees were taken from a forest farm without permission, constituting theft of property valued at 74,707.5 yuan, which satisfies the elements of the crime of theft (盗窃罪). Additionally, the act of illegally cutting and removing trees that are designated as protected ancient trees violates the criminal provision on illegal felling or damaging state‑protected forest resources (非法采伐、毁坏国家重点保护的森林、古树名木), which is punishable as a separate offense of destroying forest resources. Therefore, the conduct meets the statutory elements of both theft and illegal destruction of protected forest resources.",
